00:26:10.000 --> 00:26:16.500
<v Dr. Michael Torres>Thanks Sarah. Talk soon.

00:26:16.500 --> 00:26:23.000
<v Alex Rivera>Bye everyone!

00:26:23.000 --> 00:26:29.500
<v Sarah Chen>Bye! Have a great rest of your day.

00:26:29.500 --> 00:26:35.000
<v Dr. Michael Torres>You too. Bye now.

